{"abstract":[{"text":"Password input is a UI element that allows to securely and confidentially capture a user’s password.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"As it is based on the ","type":"text"},{"code":"MISOTextInput","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":",  it offers same layout and the same elements of configuration.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@"},{"kind":"attribute","text":"MainActor","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MISOPasswordInput"}]}]},{"content":[{"level":2,"text":"Layout","type":"heading","anchor":"Layout"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Passwords input is based on several configurable UI elements:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"label"}]},{"type":"text","text":": It is used to describe the purpose of the input."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"placeholder","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":":  A prefix is not common and is discouraged in a Password Input component. In very specific cases, it can provide","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"context or format requirements (e.g., “DEV-” for test accounts, “admin-” as a pattern to define an admin password)","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"lock icon","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": it helps to reinforce the security context."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Helper text","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":":  A supporting text conveys additional information about the password field."}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"anchor":"Outlined-style","type":"heading","text":"Outlined style","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"By ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"default"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":", the input is with a subtle background fill and invisible bottom border, creating a softer and more contained look.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["   \/\/ An outlined text input","   MISOPasswordInput(label: \"Your password\", password: $password, isOutlined: true)","","   \/\/ With a localizable from a bundle","   MISOPasswordInput(LocalizedStringKey(\"password_label\"), bundle: Bundle.module, password: $password)"]},{"anchor":"Rounded-layout","type":"heading","text":"Rounded layout","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"As the"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":" MISOTextInput"},{"type":"text","text":", rounded corners can be enabled or disabled using the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"hasRoundedTextInputs"},{"type":"text","text":" values of the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Tuning"},{"type":"text","text":" object"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"in your theme configuration."}]},{"anchor":"Status","type":"heading","text":"Status","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"As ","type":"text"},{"code":"MISOPasswordInput","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is based on the","type":"text"},{"code":" MISOTextInput","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", all the status are the same and have the same behavior available here ","type":"text"},{"code":"MISOTextInput.Status","type":"codeVoice"}]},{"text":"Accessibility considerations","level":2,"anchor":"Accessibility-considerations","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"By default no haptics are done by the component for the trailing action."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"However you should think about cases wher you will have to make the devices vibrates."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"You can refer to the "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/developer.apple.com\/design\/human-interface-guidelines\/playing-haptics","isActive":true},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Rich text","anchor":"Rich-text"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Rich text can be used for error and helper texts."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The helper text and the error message are ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOTextualContent"},{"text":" values: a raw ","type":"text"},{"code":"String","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", a localized string","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"with ","type":"text"},{"code":".localized(_:tableName:bundle:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" or a rich text with ","type":"text"},{"code":".rich(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and an ","type":"text"},{"code":"AttributedString","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Prefer ","type":"text"},{"code":".raw(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to a bare string literal for a raw helper text, so the compiler selects without any doubt the initializer","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"taking an ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOTextualContent","type":"reference"},{"text":" and does not emit a deprecation warning.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The error message is defined with ","type":"text"},{"code":"MISOTextInput.Status.textualError(message:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Strong text can be used sparingly to highlight key information within the content."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"No other text styles should be used.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Underlined text must not be applied manually (e.g. in error message), as it is commonly associated with hyperlinks and may mislead users.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Code samples","anchor":"Code-samples"},{"type":"codeListing","code":["    \/\/ The password to display and edit","    @State var password: String = \"\"","","    \/\/ A basic password input with label","    MISOPasswordInput(label: \"Password\", password: $password)","","    \/\/ Add a leading icon and helper text to more context","    MISOPasswordInput(label: \"Password\", password: $password, lockIcon: true, helperText: \"Your password must be between 8 and 20 characters long.\")","","    \/\/ The helper text can be localized or rich, the error message too","    MISOPasswordInput(label: \"Password\", password: $password, helperText: .localized(\"password_helper\", bundle: Bundle.module))","    MISOPasswordInput(label: \"Password\",","                      password: $password,","                      helperText: .rich(AttributedString(markdown: \"You should use a **strong password**\"))) \/\/ Manage in your side errors for init","    MISOPasswordInput(label: \"Password\", password: $password, status: .textualError(message: \"The password is too weak\"))","","    \/\/ Password with prefix","    MISOPasswordInput(label: \"Password\", password: $password, prefix: \"CORP-\")","","    \/\/ Make password visible","    MISOPasswordInput(label: \"Password\", password: $password, isHiddenPassword: .constant(false))"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"Version","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"1.3.1 (Figma component design version)"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"Since","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDS 1.2.0"}]}]}],"kind":"content"}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/document